= Marie Jessamy

Jessamy is the founder of the Worker's Welfare, our mutual aid organization; her experiences as a single mother in poverty led her to <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformism</span>. She is the most senior woman among the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> leadership, who is often treated as the "go-to" when the predominantly male leadership sought out womens' voices.

- @emergency_fundraising
- @welfare
- @organizing_women
