unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; emergency_used += 1; resources += 2; commons_marcher -= 2 if emergency_used > 1; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 1; disfavored_marcher -= 2 if emergency_used > 1; commons_marcher -= 2 if emergency_used > 2; disfavored_marcher -= 2 if emergency_used > 2; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 2; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 2

[? if emergency_used <= 1: Jessamy has leveraged her position to pull in donations and arrange quick loans. ?][? if emergency_used > 1 and emergency_used < 3: Discontent is brewing among the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>'s rank and file due to our persistent attempts at begging for money. ?][? if emergency_used > 2: We’re really scraping the barrel now—committed members are pressured into selling their valuables, while many others leave in frustration. ?]

