We have increased funding to Workers' Welfare. [? if veran_crash_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@organizing_women
title: Organizing women
subtitle: Jessamy's strategies are aimed at more "traditional" women.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: womens_rights += 1; commons_marcher += 4*(1-dissent); landed_marcher += 3*(1-dissent); guild_marcher += 3*(1-dissent); advisor_action_timer = 6

Jessamy's strategies for organizing women are aimed at working-class housewives, and acknowledge women's traditional household roles. We argue that our economic welfare programs will improve the livelihoods of women and their families.

[? if marcher_r < 50 : Unfortunately, women still disproportionately support the bourgeois parties. ?]
